"text": "[image: A full hall in Usk for the Pend Oreille County Democrats fundraiser – good food, good company, and a couple of dogs who came along for the conversation. Pend Oreille County is big, rural, and easy for Washington, D.C. to overlook. The people here are organized, generous, and paying close attention to this race. Thank you for having me, and for all the work you are doing to turn out every vote up north.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeQEmSkCHPH/"
