"text": "[image: Front page of the Seattle Times: \"Democrats say U.S. House race is in play.\" National Democrats consider us a District in Play. Incumbent Michael Baumgartner was the only Republican on the primary ballot, and most voters here voted for change. Nobody handed us this. Volunteers, house party hosts, and neighbors chipping in $26 at a time put this seat on the map. Now let's finish the job. https://secure.actblue.com/donate/cc-soc-2609]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeUyerzADQf/"
},
{
"text": "[image: James joined his brother Murphy at the campaign office – it's safe to say both are keenly interested in the yard sign situation. Our office runs on volunteers, coffee, and lately a fair amount of dog hair. Come by and say hello. The welcoming committee is ready.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeUkweLFB4w/"
},
