"text": "[image: Thank you to our hosts, the Chases and Kuhlings, for inviting your friends to join us! A beautiful old living room, every chair filled, and neighbors who came ready with good questions and stayed long after the last one. Ballots arrive soon! If you would like to host a gathering like this before then, we would love to come: https://conroy4congress.com/volunteer]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeVN86diMkj/"
},
