"text": "[image: Walla Walla — we need you! Help Carmela Conroy and Derek Sarley and the Vote NO on 645! campaign for two combined canvasses this weekend as we talk with voters and build support across the community. Friday, October 9 | 4–6 PM Sunday, October 11 | 11 AM–1 PM Every door knocked and every conversation matters. Grab a friend, sign up, and come help us finish strong! Sign Up Here! https://www.mobilize.us/conroyforcongress/event/1054338/]",
